 "description": "D1 draft mission 'go to a point, kill three enemies, return', built by rewriting sub-mission 33 (SubM_04_Down_SomSal_Kill, Map02 SUBMAP02, the sombrero seller). Start: Ram at TELEPORTPOINT_SubM_04 (143.36, 0.03, 248.62). Objective 1 'Go to the enemy' with a radar blip on the go-to trigger Close_door_A_TRIGGER (157.0, 0.41, 343.7). Crossing it spawns/aggroes the first enemy team reduced to three (Peter, Peter01, Brian); objective 2 counts '%0 out of %1 Banditos killed' to 3. When the three are dead the return trigger (moved to (141.0, 1.2, 258.0), disabled at load) is enabled and blipped, objective 3 'Find the sombrero seller' shows. Entering it completes objective 3, and the shipped Sombrero_Picked_Up root (AND of that and objective 2 completed) ends the mission with success after 6 s. overdose.main: objective texts, MaxCounter 3, pass score 0. First_Enemy_team_KILL_Completed is a count trigger (TriggerOn 2): ConditionsNeeded raised from 2 to 3. The two pickup feedback texts ('You picked up the sombrero', 'Now kill the rest!') are removed. The dormant 14-kill root All_Enemies_Kill_Completed and the action that disabled its text are removed. The entrance door SM04_DoorA (closed behind Ram at the go-to trigger) is opened again 1.5 s after the third kill so the way back is free.",
